 "stimulus_html": "<p>Use the following scenario and graph to answer question 1.</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Functions <span data-math=\"R\">R</span> and <span data-math=\"D\">D</span> give the height, in feet, of a toy rocket and a drone, <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> seconds after they are released.</p>\n</blockquote>",
